[
  {
    "id": "anno-tate_upper_p125_left-00",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "右亥四郡川々魚漁運上海濱立網運上諸職人諸商人質屋糀屋酒屋醬油屋等之諸稅凡〆高如斯但巨細帳之儀賊有中紛亂急速取調兼候ニ付追而差上可申候"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "右、亥年分、四郡の川々の魚漁運上、海浜の立網運上、諸職人・諸商人・質屋・糀屋・酒屋・醤油屋等の諸税、およその〆高は右のとおりである。ただし、詳細な帳簿については、賊のいた間の紛乱により急いで取り調べることができなかったので、追って差し上げ申し上げる。"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "The above, for the Year of the Boar: for the four districts, the licence dues on river fishing and on shore set-net fishing, together with the various taxes on artisans, merchants, pawnbrokers, malt-houses, sake brewers, soy-sauce brewers and the like — the approximate aggregate is as shown. As for the itemised ledger, the disorder while the rebels were present prevented a prompt investigation, so it will be submitted at a later date."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "諸稅凡〆高追而差上候書"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
